Query a list of CITY and STATE from the STATION table.

              STATION
------------------------------------
        FIELD    |     TYPE
------------------------------------
        ID       |      NUMBER
------------------------------------
       CITY      |    VARCHAR2(21)
------------------------------------
      STATE      |    VARCHAR2(2)
------------------------------------
      LAT_N      |     NUMBER
------------------------------------
      LAT_W      |     NUMBER
------------------------------------

Solution:

SELECT CITY, STATE
FROM STATION;
